# <type>(<scope>): <what changed — imperative, max 72 chars>
#
# Why:       the problem or motivation — what was wrong or missing,
#            how it showed up
# What:      the change itself, key decisions, rejected alternatives
# Verified:  how it was checked (check, test, measurement) — or
#            "not verified" plus the reason
# Follow-up: open ends, known limitations, next steps (omit if none)
#
# Types:  feat fix refactor docs chore test perf build ci
# Scopes: a crate or app name (dsp, audio-engine, transport, control,
#         desktop, xtask, infra) or docs. One logical change per commit.
# The git history is the logbook — see CLAUDE.md, "Git & Logbook".
